#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:3
#: 1b02b47a81f5432495fd9a23a5507c52
msgid "分支合并（Branch Merge）"
msgstr "Branch Merge"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:5
#: eb89f90f56ee4e6e8012dafbd07aff6b
msgid "**分类：** 容器"
msgstr "**Category:** Containers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:7
#: 9a3fbb45453247708f3f2d6ab541f349
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:9
#: 277eaa7996174dd1bba8e90482c106af
msgid "让多张卡片读取同一份输入，并把结果合并为一个数据集。适合从同一批结构分别生成表面、空位或扰动结构。"
msgstr ""
"Let multiple cards read the same input and merge their results into one "
"dataset. This is useful for generating surfaces, vacancies, or perturbed "
"structures independently from the same input batch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:11
#: 0f3e990c10f24ac28c1119a8108bd7bc
msgid "这里的“分支”表示数据关系，不表示并行计算。启用的子卡按界面顺序运行，但每张子卡都读取原始组输入，不读取上一张子卡的输出。"
msgstr ""
"Here, a branch describes the data relationship rather than parallel "
"execution. Enabled child cards run in interface order, but every child "
"reads the original group input instead of the previous child's output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:13
#: 750ae416477e459d8fcb0739d12f1eca
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:15
#: cfef7d519c3e4e30a95c571f2fa0cbe3
msgid "设组输入为数据集 $\\mathcal D$，启用的子卡操作为 $O_1,\\ldots,O_m$。分支合并的结果是"
msgstr ""
"Let the group input be dataset $\\mathcal D$, and let the enabled child-"
"card operations be $O_1,\\ldots,O_m$. Branch Merge returns"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:18
#: 8ecf6588be78441182a4d36b6874ab89
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{merge}}=\n"
"O_1(\\mathcal D)\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\cdots\\mathbin{\\Vert}O_m(\\mathcal "
"D),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:23
#: 0ef8982d4eea41a3b75aab9ca7cf0776
msgid ""
"其中 $\\Vert$ 表示按子卡顺序拼接。若配置后置过滤卡 $F$，最终输出为 $F(\\mathcal "
"D_{\\mathrm{merge}})$。"
msgstr ""
"Here $\\Vert$ denotes concatenation in child-card order. If a post-filter"
" card $F$ is configured, the final output is $F(\\mathcal "
"D_{\\mathrm{merge}})$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:26
#: 63f932f8d1594a558093b55f441124d9
msgid "例如输入 2 个结构，两张子卡分别输出 6 个和 8 个结构，则合并后为 14 个；后置过滤保留 5 个时，卡片会显示“合并 14 → 保留 5”。"
msgstr ""
"For example, if two input structures are processed by child cards that "
"produce 6 and 8 structures, the merged result contains 14. If a post-"
"filter retains 5, the card displays `merged 14 → retained 5`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:28
#: b65ec8914c9b4665bbd26c272ded4954
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:30
#: b669540f28294df9b75f894f8311d3d8
msgid "以一份弛豫后的 Ni 超胞为输入："
msgstr "Start from a relaxed Ni supercell:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:32
#: f5ec5a0ee32e4c0099a26d2d63f29fd5
msgid "选中“分支合并”，加入 `表面薄层扫描` 和 `定向空位`。"
msgstr "Select `Branch Merge`, then add `Surface Slab Scan` and `Targeted Vacancy`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:33
#: 90dd54b1632a4c65b57307df32a7e6e7
msgid "两张子卡分别配置表面和空位参数，并保持启用。"
msgstr ""
"Configure the surface and vacancy parameters in the two child cards and "
"keep both enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:34
#: a3fc724faced4f5ca4415f79e3b5986c
msgid "如需统一筛选，在后置过滤槽加入一张过滤卡。"
msgstr ""
"To filter the combined results, add one filter card to the post-filter "
"slot."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:35
#: 206ae2918e754ffaa81043d898b16797
msgid "运行后，输出按子卡顺序合并；卡片底部显示合并前后的实际数量。"
msgstr ""
"After the run, outputs are merged in child-card order. The bottom of the "
"card shows the actual counts before and after merging."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:37
#: e8dc42f77aca41d2803b73b5969cb633
msgid "什么时候用、什么时候不用"
msgstr "When to use a Card Group"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:39
#: eaa969c368594374a60c5533530ef137
msgid "子卡彼此独立、结果需要立即合并：使用“分支合并”。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Merge` when child cards are independent and their results "
"should be merged immediately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:40
#: b9cd4752d0fd4938b6dc75f35d179bbb
msgid "每条分支还要继续连接多张卡，或暂时保持独立输出：使用“永久分叉”。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Branch Fork` when each branch needs its own downstream card chain or"
" its output must remain separate for now."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:41
#: 874b68d6fbac4b04a1e736e1fa1c13ce
msgid "A 的输出要成为 B 的输入：把 A、B 放在工作流中顺序连接。"
msgstr ""
"If the output of A must become the input of B, connect A and B "
"sequentially in the workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:43
#: 4cd9841b2b214bb485d24661cd2ceade
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:45
#: 5c760569f9074385b93b27e2aed8b7c7
msgid "`card_list`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:47
#: bfe24298a28749629dd1b62d3db31055
msgid "组内子卡列表，由界面自动维护。界面顺序决定运行和合并顺序，但不构成前后数据依赖。"
msgstr ""
"List of child cards in the group, maintained automatically by the "
"interface. Interface order determines execution and merge order, but it "
"does not create a sequential data dependency."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:49
#: 9e12e6e9ef4447ada85907213d0be281
msgid "关闭整个组时，输入直接传给下游，子卡的启用状态会保留。组处于启用状态时，至少要启用一张子卡；否则运行会明确失败，不会把输入误当作结果。"
msgstr ""
"When the entire group is disabled, its input passes directly downstream "
"and the enabled states of its child cards are preserved. When the group "
"is enabled, at least one child card must also be enabled. Otherwise, the "
"run fails explicitly rather than treating the input as a generated "
"result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:51
#: ddded97a53064d3797841a06af1ed3a9
msgid "`filter_card`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:53
#: ca30c387552b451aba65b2ab1f907e93
msgid "可选的后置过滤卡，默认 `null`。它接收完整的合并结果，一个组最多放一张。禁用过滤卡时只合并，不筛选。"
msgstr ""
"Optional post-filter card, default `null`. It receives the complete "
"merged result, and a group can contain at most one. When the filter card "
"is disabled, outputs are merged without filtering."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:55
#: 69a3960f7a364430b661c3713ac2ec68
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:57
#: e0ae5be2d6a04f5cac36b3473c624932
msgid "`分支合并(表面薄层扫描, 插隙与吸附)`：从同一输入生成表面与缺陷结构并合并。"
msgstr "`Branch Merge(Surface Slab Scan, Interstitial & Adsorbate)`: Generate surface and defect structures from the same input and merge them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:58
#: ce9b2821759b45718ab7c7bc5e016b58
msgid "`分支合并(原子扰动, 晶格随机扰动) + FPS 代表性采样`：合并两类扰动，再统一补选代表性结构。"
msgstr "`Branch Merge(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb) + FPS Sampling`: Merge two perturbation families and then select representative structures from the combined set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:60
#: 221b560b163f4576888336bf77e2a132
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:62
#: 25c681c911754d46b7dfba9c03091260
msgid "**组输出为空。** 先检查是否至少启用一张子卡，再检查各子卡参数。任一子卡失败时，组会清空已经收集的结果并停止后续分支。"
msgstr ""
"**The group output is empty.** First confirm that at least one child card"
" is enabled, then inspect the child-card parameters. If any child card "
"fails, the group clears already collected results and stops the remaining"
" branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:64
#: ebf3c1b1e2f74d3a8c3cfd8fb3f6e256
msgid ""
"**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤阈值可能过严，例如几何阈值不适合当前体系，或 FPS "
"描述符距离阈值导致提前停止。先看过滤卡自己的预览和错误信息，再调整参数。"
msgstr ""
"**The in-group filter removed every result.** The `filter_card` "
"thresholds may be too strict—for example, the geometry limits may not "
"suit this system, or the FPS descriptor-distance threshold may stop "
"selection too early. Inspect the filter card's preview and error message "
"before adjusting its parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:66
#: d4fc41e3905e4738be78067f22ce9f40
msgid "**后置过滤后为 0。** 过滤执行成功，但当前条件没有保留任何结构。查看过滤卡的预览，再调整阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**The post-filter retained zero structures.** Filtering completed "
"successfully, but no structure satisfied the current conditions. Inspect "
"the filter card's preview and adjust its thresholds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:68
#: e86db5fd950442faa12df096947a6d50
msgid "保存字段"
msgstr "Saved Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:70
#: 1084e1f032da4ab08d4fca6b6de2e93d
msgid "`card_list`：按界面顺序保存的子卡配置。"
msgstr "`card_list`: Child-card configurations saved in interface order."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:71
#: 529cc4ec4bba4d2da52f637648ded506
msgid "`filter_card`：后置过滤卡配置；未设置时为 `null`。"
msgstr "`filter_card`: Post-filter card configuration, or `null` when none is set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:73
#: 5783f5101098403d8e4d57e568e0a317
msgid "旧工作流中的类名 `CardGroup` 保持可加载，但启用的空组不再直通输入，会提示至少启用一张子卡。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy class name `CardGroup` in existing workflows remains loadable."
" An enabled empty group no longer passes its input through; it reports "
"that at least one child card must be enabled."

